  <!-- ==================== M6 options (drawn by FpSettings.DrawSection; the keys live here with the features) ==================== -->
  <R3D_Fp_Settings_EyeLead>Camera lead when walking</R3D_Fp_Settings_EyeLead>
  <R3D_Fp_Settings_EyeLeadTip>A walk starts when the game receives your key, a moment later with a friend. Meanwhile the view moves a little ahead (at most a third of a cell) so starting feels immediate; it settles back once your colonist walks.</R3D_Fp_Settings_EyeLeadTip>
  <R3D_Fp_Settings_HeadBob>Head bob</R3D_Fp_Settings_HeadBob>
  <R3D_Fp_Settings_HeadBobTip>A slight up and down movement of the view while walking. 0 is none.</R3D_Fp_Settings_HeadBobTip>
  <R3D_Fp_Settings_FriendTags>Show who plays which colonist</R3D_Fp_Settings_FriendTags>
  <R3D_Fp_Settings_FriendTagsTip>In multiplayer, a tag with the player's name over each colonist another player controls in first person, with a small ring while their skill check runs and its result over it.</R3D_Fp_Settings_FriendTagsTip>

